/*!50100 PARTITION BY RANGE (`a`)
(PARTITION p0a VALUES LESS THAN (5) ENGINE = ROCKSDB,
 PARTITION p0b VALUES LESS THAN (10) ENGINE = ROCKSDB,
 PARTITION p1 VALUES LESS THAN (20) ENGINE = ROCKSDB,
 PARTITION p2 VALUES LESS THAN (30) ENGINE = ROCKSDB) */
